7. Self‑rewrite safety

Anchored invariants:

Certain capsules (type: ANCHOR) are:

Non‑rewritable without explicit designer override.

Always checked before promotion.

MetaSelfRewriteController enforces:

Local rewrites only (bounded change per epoch).

Rollback path via encrypted capsule snapshots.

Kill‑switch condition if instability metrics exceed thresholds.

